rd, an experimental robotic surgery system.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-tale-archive-ii">Featured Tale Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>CanonCon 1st Place Team: Tufto</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/like-clockwork-hub">...Like Clockwork Hub</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by multiple contributors</p> </div> <p><em>Eventually, the answer will come for why things are the way they are.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-goi-format-archive">Featured GoI Format Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>CanonCon 1st Place Team: Woedenaz</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3219">SCP-3219: This Sour Earth</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>SCP-3219 has been linked to ninety-six disappearances since its discovery.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight Archive</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div class="news-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>News</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>August 27, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>Another site contest on the SCP Wiki is open for entering - go check out the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">Canon Renaissance Contest</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>May 1, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>The SCP Wiki's new site contest is open for entering - go check out the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/exquisite-corpse-contest">Exquisite Corpse Contest</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>April 19, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>The Wanderer's Library's new site contest is open for posting - go check out the <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/wanderers-depths-contest">Wanderer's Depths</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>April 1, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>A number of articles changed their seasonal colors for April Fool's Day and turned into <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/april-fools-2020">Super Cool Plants</a> entries.</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>March 29, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/144-hour-jam-contest-two">144-Hour Jam Contest Two</a> has come to a close! Nearly two hundred contest entries were submitted over the course of six days!</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/archived-news">Archived News</a></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="international-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Official Sister Sites</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/SerpHand.png" alt="SerpHand.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/system:join">The Wanderers Library</a> &#8212; Fiction From Another World.</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>The Wanderers Library is the Foundation's sister site and features the endless stories contained within the Library, home to the Serpents Hand and readers of all shapes and sizes.</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admin